        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 94ab740b-b30f-4086-9aea-5c9c0de28456).Image",
        "Description": "Good day 47, and welcome back to Sapienza, Italy. Today we have three targets, So lets get started. Francesca de Santis, a scientist who lives in Silvio Caruso&apos;s mansion, who does paperwork upstairs, and makes phone calls. And as always, you can be very creative with this one 47. And last but not least, the couple Maria Torraca, and Rico Siciliano. They are old Caruso workers who have worked with the virus. They know too much about it 47. Take them out. I wish just luck for you agent. Have fun!",
